---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy"
  description="How Healthy collects, uses, and protects your information."
>
  <article class="legal">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="updated">Last updated: 5 September 2026</p>

    <p>
      This privacy policy describes how Healthy handles information when you visit our website or
      join our waitlist. This is a placeholder policy for early access. We will update it before
      launch.
    </p>

    <h2>Information we collect</h2>
    <p>
      If you join the waitlist, we collect the email address you provide. We may also collect basic
      technical data such as browser type and approximate location from server logs.
    </p>

    <h2>How we use information</h2>
    <p>
      We use waitlist emails to notify you about product updates, launch availability, and related
      communications. We do not sell your personal information.
    </p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>
      Questions about this policy can be sent to
      <a href="mailto:privacy@gethealthyapp.com">privacy@gethealthyapp.com</a>.
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
